# The root .gitignore's `!apps/mobile/**` re-include block (legacy of the removed
# vendored app) would otherwise re-add these generated directories; deeper rules
# take precedence over the root negations.
node_modules/
.expo/
# CNG（expo prebuild）流程：android/ 目录是生成产物，勿提交（与根 .gitignore 的 ios/ 同一约定）
android/
